  "instrument": "guitar",
  "teaches": "technique",
  "style": "Rock",
  "instructions": "Up pentatonic box 1, picking the first note on each string and hammering the second; then down, picking the higher note and pulling off to the lower. Hammer with the fingertip, hard and right behind the fret; pull off by flicking the string down, not lifting. The legato note should be as loud as the picked one.",
